 and unavailable-measurement behavior, title sanitization, member heads, merge topology, manifest format, claims and transport checks.\n- Add Git fixtures for sequential increments, unrelated newer-main Lean content, conflicts, zero deltas, sanitization and unavailable measurements; record the policy integration in EVOLUTION.\n\n### Testing\n- Published head `d18e4e7674c2366324e5e5265e5ceee485737934`: all nine local CI statuses passed in 421 seconds. All eight gates ran, including build, blueprint rendering, synchronization and statement-origin.\n- The CI workflow suite passed 729 tests with 9 skipped. Normal commit hooks also passed 729 tests with 9 skipped; the focused train suite passed 26 tests, and the additional unavailable-measurement fixture passed.\n- The rooted axiom audit passed 1,659 declarations with zero failures and three existing statement-level warnings. Syntax, whitespace, hook setup and all four author artifact hashes were verified.\n- Git-backed fixtures exercised member subjects and transport behavior; no live train has run.\n\n---\nAddresses #590\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T04:52:26Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T05:26:03Z", "closed_at": "2026-09-18T05:26:03Z", "merged_at": "2026-09-18T05:26:03Z", "merge_commit_sha": "b6c09eb0cb53d791fd6796245a09054073cf0cc1", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025011061, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8bdQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/infrastructure", "name": "infrastructure", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Foundational definitions, shared APIs, or supporting layers", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "draft": false, "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/592/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/pulls/592/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A